### pg_cron Jobs (Day 4 SQL)

```sql
-- Job 1: Nightly late delivery check (runs at 00:05 each day)
select cron.schedule(
  'check_late_deliveries',
  '5 0 * * *',
  'select check_late_deliveries()'
);

-- Job 2: Hourly cash not deposited check
select cron.schedule(
  'check_cash_not_deposited',
  '0 * * * *',
  'select job_cash_not_deposited_check()'
);
```

> [!NOTE]
> `job_cash_not_deposited_check()` already exists in `mdos_v8_all_fixes.sql`. Only the `cron.schedule()` call needs to be added. `check_late_deliveries()` is new — copies invoice's actual delivery_status (not hardcoded 'pending').

