### Detailed Page Specs

#### Tab 7 Page 1 — Stock Discrepancy Report

- **Filters**: only products where `physical_qty ≠ system_qty` (Diff ≠ 0)
- **Table**: Product · System Qty · Physical Qty · Diff · Audit Date · Status · **Edit / Delete**
- **Edit**: Status dropdown (Resolved / Disputed); **Resolved requires typed reason**; Disputed does not
- **Export CSV + Excel**

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Products where Diff = 0 are **excluded entirely**. The page queries `stock_audit_items` joined to `stock_audits`, filtering where `system_qty ≠ physical_qty`.

#### Tab 7 Page 2 — Real-Time Alerts Feed

- **Supabase Realtime** subscription inside `AlertsFeed` client component (channel: `alerts:tenant_id=eq.<id>`)
- **Table**: Time · Alert Type · Details · Severity · Status · **Mark Read**
- **Alert types ONLY**: `cash_not_deposited` / `overdue_threshold` (no delivery_dispute)
- **Mark Read** is the only action — no Resolved/Disputed, no reason
- **Export CSV + Excel**

#### System Settings Page

- **Section 2 — Global Features**: Auto-Assign toggle → writes `tenant_settings.auto_assign_enabled`
- **Section 3 — Alert Configuration**:
  - Cash Not Deposited toggle + "Set Hrs" input → `tenant_alert_settings.cash_not_deposited_enabled` + `cash_not_deposited_hours`
  - Overdue Threshold toggle + "Set Days" input → `tenant_alert_settings.overdue_alert_enabled` + `overdue_alert_days` (default 0)
